{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/product/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/[capability]/layout,_N_T_/product/[agent]/[capability]/page,_N_T_/product/gravity/brand-assets"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" imageSrcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/91d486bf57bf1762.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03f7c6bc932ce1e3.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-b11b2651f33aae7f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/117-4f5b424f20efdcae.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-6cdff17d3be181bf.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/972-8c0ee6fabcd1342f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/309-526a3bc2ba734d25.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/878-ed980f2cac33ad8c.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/product/%5Bagent%5D/%5Bcapability%5D/page-d5bbfe18c698dac4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/739-3ece649a7e02ff75.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-5a72189eaa6243d0.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><title>Brand Asset Library &amp; Product Inventory — Gravity | Nebulaa | Nebulaa.ai</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Keep your logo, palette, product photography and store imagery on file so every generated visual is built from your actual brand.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"AI marketing automation India,AI outreach agent,GTM for startups,WhatsApp sales automation,AI sales agent SMB India\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://nebulaa.ai\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Brand Asset Library &amp; Product Inventory — Gravity | Nebulaa\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Keep your logo, palette, product photography and store imagery on file so every generated visual is built from your actual brand.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@nebulaaai\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Nebulaa.ai — AI Marketing &amp; Outreach for Founders\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Two AI agents. Your entire GTM. Automated.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"16x16\"/><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,500;1,600&amp;family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"legalName\":\"Noburo Business Services LLP\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\",\"email\":\"hello@nebulaa.ai\",\"description\":\"Nebulaa is a Chennai-based AI marketing company. It builds two agents — Gravity for marketing and Pulsar for outreach — and runs managed marketing engagements for brands across South India.\",\"foundingDate\":\"2025\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chennai\",\"addressRegion\":\"Tamil Nadu\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"},\"makesOffer\":[{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"price\":\"10000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"description\":\"Reads a website and builds a marketing strategy from it, plans the month, drafts posts, carousels and reels, tracks competitors, runs campaigns and creator collaborations, and handles the social inbox.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"price\":\"15000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Pulsar\",\"description\":\"Answers enquiries on WhatsApp, email and SMS within minutes, qualifies budget, timeline and fit, scores every lead, and runs broadcasts, automation and voice calling.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"price\":\"20000\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Both agents\",\"description\":\"Gravity and Pulsar on one account, sharing the same brand memory.\"}}]}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-ground text-ink font-body antialiased\"><nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-b border-rule transition-all duration-300 bg-ground/80 backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"transform:translateY(-64px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between py-7 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><a class=\"flex-shrink-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Nebulaa.ai\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity dark:hidden\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-light.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" fetchPriority=\"high\" loading=\"eager\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-10 w-auto hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity brightness-110 hidden dark:block\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flogo-dark.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75\"/></a><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-[38px]\"><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Product<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/channels\">Channels<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\" href=\"/services\">Services<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"relative font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors group\">Pricing<span class=\"absolute -bottom-0.5 left-0 w-0 h-px bg-gold group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-300\"></span></a><div class=\"relative\"><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Product\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Brand assets\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity/brand-assets\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Gravity — Brand assets\",\"description\":\"Keep your logo, palette, product photography and store imagery on file so every generated visual is built from your actual brand.\",\"applicationCategory\":\"BusinessApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/product/gravity/brand-assets\"}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[130px] pb-[80px]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/product\">Product</a><span>/</span><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/product/gravity\">Gravity</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-muted\">Brand assets</span></nav><div class=\"max-w-[880px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[24px] block\">Gravity · assets</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[58px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Your logo, colours and<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">products, on file.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px] mb-9\">Generated creative only looks like your brand if the system knows what your brand looks like. Gravity keeps your logo, palette, product photography and store imagery on hand, and builds every visual from them.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">How it works</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Three steps, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">start to finish.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Upload once</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Logo, brand colours, product shots and store or facility imagery.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Everything is built from them</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Generated creative uses your actual assets rather than stock that vaguely matches.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[22px] text-gold-text mb-3 tabular-nums\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Inventory stays current</h3><p class=\"text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted\">Add products as they launch and they become available to the content plan straight away.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,420px)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-[80px] gap-y-10\"><div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">What you get</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[40px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">Concretely, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">this.</span></h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">A brand asset library the content engine actually draws on</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Product inventory that content can be planned around</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Store and environment imagery for backgrounds and context</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Consistent use of your logo and palette across every format</span></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[44px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">Questions</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">The ones people <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">actually ask.</span></h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if I do not have good product photography?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Gravity can generate product visuals from what you have. Photography is also part of the managed service if you want the real thing.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I have more than one brand?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — separate brands are kept separate, which matters if you run multiple businesses or manage client accounts.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who owns the assets and the output?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You do. Accounts, content and data are in your name and leave with you if you go.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">What if I do not have good product photography?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Can I have more than one brand?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Who owns the assets and the output?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Also in <!-- -->Gravity</span><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/strategy-icp\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Strategy &amp; ICP</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Reads your URL and builds the strategy — tone, ICP, channels, competitors.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/content-planning\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Content planning</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">A whole month mapped against your pillars, with festivals already in it.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/product/gravity/create\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Content creation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Posts, carousels and creative drafted in your brand voice, ready to edit.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[46px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Give it a URL.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">See what it makes of you.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[460px] mx-auto mb-9\">Seven days free, no card. If it is not writing something worth publishing by day two, nothing is lost.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transitio